      <Comment source="O-27, pujar">A cDNA clone encoding a putative ferric chelate reductase OsFRO2 was isolated from |FRAME: TAX-4527 &lt;i&gt;Oryza&lt;/i&gt;|. Northern blot analysis showed that transcripts are expressed only in leaves of Fe-deficient rice plants. The reductase activity is beleived to be impaired based on imperfectly conserved cofactor-binding motifs |CITS: [16412081]|.</Comment>
