      <Comment source="O-27, pujar">A cDNA clone encoding a putative ferric chelate reductase was isolated from |FRAME: TAX-4527 &lt;i&gt;Oryza&lt;/i&gt;|. It has homology to |FRAME: TAX-3701 &lt;i&gt;Arabidopsis&lt;/i&gt;| FRO1. Northern blot analysis revealed that transcripts are expressed in the leaves of Zn-, Cu- and Mn-deficient rice plants |CITS: [16412081]|.</Comment>
